in612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6347384/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみっにゅんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hinapyoooon (´・ｘ・*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6347384/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6347384/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22751":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、アルバムの握手会！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってたよりもたくさんの方が来てくださって\nすごく嬉しかったヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\nの衣装！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しのねねがセンターだったり\n懐かしい衣装だし、披露する場が少なかったので\n着たくなっちゃって♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次なに着ようか迷うな〜(> <)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにがいいっ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は、10枚目最後の握手会でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださって、\n本当私も楽しかったし素敵なひとときでしたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から楽しめたし笑顔になれました！！！\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生最後の個別握手会ということで、\n中3組で合わせて制服を着たんだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服は愛未が貸してくれました。\nありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶ。中3組。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中3から一緒だったのに、\nもう高3が終わってしまうよ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いなあ。寂しいなあ。(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からずっと大好きな2人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天真爛漫でお嬢様ないくちゃんと\n冷静で真面目で人懐っこいひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2人と同い年で、仲良くなれて\n本当よかったなあヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶよ。らぶ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部では、ツインをしましたー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年もやってなかった(はず)だし\n人前でツインすることなんてないから\nすごいレアだったー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ恥ずかしかったけど、\nちはるーむめいとさん達が\nすごい褒めてくれたから嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部では、ストレート降ろし！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレートも人気あってよかったな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、5部の後には\n生誕祭を開いてくれました♡(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の皆さんが、\nすごい時間や労力を費やして\n頑張ってくれていた生誕祭。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの頑張りが伝わってきました。(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンや、ブース。\nちはるーむ掲示板やアルバム。\nパーカーやメンバーからのお手紙。\nひとりひとりのメッセージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとに嬉しかったですヽ(；；)丿。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、素敵なファンの方々を持って\n本当に幸せだなと改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝しています。\nしてもしきれないけど。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがいてくれて、よかった。\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の支えです。本当に。。\nありがとうヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、たくさんのファンの方も\n5部終わりで疲れてたり、時間も遅い中で\n残っててくださいましたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"photo by まひろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/02/08/0743152/0009.jpeg","alt